import{_ as e,W as a,X as n,a2 as s}from"./framework-6a3aa88c.js";const i={},l=s(`<h1 id="第八课-deployment-滚动更新与回滚" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#第八课-deployment-滚动更新与回滚" aria-hidden="true">#</a> 第八课：Deployment 滚动更新与回滚</h1><h2 id="这节课只解决一个问题" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#这节课只解决一个问题" aria-hidden="true">#</a> 这节课只解决一个问题</h2><p>线上有三个正在运行的旧版本 Pod，怎样升级镜像，同时避免一次性把三个旧 Pod 全部停掉？如果新版本有问题，又怎样恢复？</p><p>Deployment 默认采用滚动更新：</p><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-ext="text"><pre class="language-text"><code>逐步创建新版本 Pod
逐步删除旧版本 Pod
直到全部替换完成
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>如果发布失败，可以回滚到上一次版本。</p><h2 id="一、为什么不能先删光再重建" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#一、为什么不能先删光再重建" aria-hidden="true">#</a> 一、为什么不能先删光再重建</h2><p>当前有三个旧版本 Pod：</p><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-ext="text"><pre class="language-text"><code>旧 Pod A
旧 Pod B
旧 Pod C
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>最直接但风险很高的更新方式是：</p><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-ext="text"><pre class="language-text"><code>同时删除 A、B、C
        ↓
再创建三个新 Pod
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>中间会出现没有 Pod 提供服务的时间。</p><p>滚动更新的思路是逐批替换：</p><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-ext="text"><pre class="language-text"><code>第 1 步：旧、旧、旧
第 2 步：新、旧、旧
第 3 步：新、新、旧
第 4 步：新、新、新
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>这张图只表达核心思想。实际过程中 Kubernetes 可能短暂多创建一个 Pod，替换顺序也不保证与图完全一致。</p><h2 id="二、先部署旧版本" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#二、先部署旧版本" aria-hidden="true">#</a> 二、先部署旧版本</h2><p>实验文件：<code>labs/06-滚动更新/01-nginx-deployment-v1.yaml</code></p><p>在线阅读时，请先把下面的完整 YAML 保存到这个路径：</p><div class="language-yaml line-numbers-mode" data-ext="yml"><pre class="language-yaml"><code><span class="token key atrule">apiVersion</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> apps/v1
<span class="token key atrule">kind</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> Deployment
<span class="token key atrule">metadata</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span>
  <span class="token key atrule">name</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> qingyun<span class="token punctuation">-</span>mall<span class="token punctuation">-</span>web
  <span class="token key atrule">labels</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span>
    <span class="token key atrule">app</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> qingyun<span class="token punctuation">-</span>mall
    <span class="token key atrule">tier</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> frontend
    <span class="token key atrule">environment</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> development
<span class="token key atrule">spec</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span>
  <span class="token key atrule">replicas</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> <span class="token number">3</span>
  <span class="token key atrule">selector</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span>
    <span class="token key atrule">matchLabels</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span>
      <span class="token key atrule">app</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> qingyun<span class="token punctuation">-</span>mall
      <span class="token key atrule">tier</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> frontend
  <span class="token key atrule">template</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span>
    <span class="token key atrule">metadata</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span>
      <span class="token key atrule">labels</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span>
        <span class="token key atrule">app</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> qingyun<span class="token punctuation">-</span>mall
        <span class="token key atrule">tier</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> frontend
        <span class="token key atrule">environment</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> development
    <span class="token key atrule">spec</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span>
      <span class="token key atrule">containers</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span>
        <span class="token punctuation">-</span> <span class="token key atrule">name</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> nginx
          <span class="token key atrule">image</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> nginx<span class="token punctuation">:</span><span class="token number">1.26</span>
          <span class="token key atrule">ports</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span>
            <span class="token punctuation">-</span> <span class="token key atrule">containerPort</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> <span class="token number">80</span>
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>如果目录不存在，先执行：</p><div class="language-bash line-numbers-mode" data-ext="sh"><pre class="language-bash"><code><span class="token function">mkdir</span> <span class="token parameter variable">-p</span> labs/06-滚动更新
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>其中最重要的两处是：</p><div class="language-yaml line-numbers-mode" data-ext="yml"><pre class="language-yaml"><code><span class="token key atrule">replicas</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> <span class="token number">3</span>
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>表示维持三个 Pod；</p><div class="language-yaml line-numbers-mode" data-ext="yml"><pre class="language-yaml"><code><span class="token key atrule">image</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> nginx<span class="token punctuation">:</span><span class="token number">1.26</span>
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>表示初始镜像版本是 Nginx 1.26。</p><p>进入课程目录：</p><div class="language-bash line-numbers-mode" data-ext="sh"><pre class="language-bash"><code><span class="token builtin class-name">cd</span> /Users/qintianpeng/2026/code/k8s
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>创建 Deployment：</p><div class="language-bash line-numbers-mode" data-ext="sh"><pre class="language-bash"><code>kubectl apply <span class="token parameter variable">-f</span> labs/06-滚动更新/01-nginx-deployment-v1.yaml
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>等待部署完成：</p><div class="language-bash line-numbers-mode" data-ext="sh"><pre class="language-bash"><code>kubectl rollout status deployment/qingyun-mall-web
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>看到下面这行表示三个旧版本 Pod 都已准备好：</p><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-ext="text"><pre class="language-text"><code>deployment &quot;qingyun-mall-web&quot; successfully rolled out
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>查看 Pod：</p><div class="language-bash line-numbers-mode" data-ext="sh"><pre class="language-bash"><code>kubectl get pods <span class="token parameter variable">-l</span> <span class="token string">&#39;app=qingyun-mall,tier=frontend&#39;</span>
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>应该有三个 <code>1/1 Running</code>。</p><h2 id="三、确认当前使用的镜像" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#三、确认当前使用的镜像" aria-hidden="true">#</a> 三、确认当前使用的镜像</h2><p>执行：</p><div class="language-bash line-numbers-mode" data-ext="sh"><pre class="language-bash"><code>kubectl get deployment qingyun-mall-web <span class="token punctuation">\\</span>
  <span class="token parameter variable">-o</span> <span class="token assign-left variable">jsonpath</span><span class="token operator">=</span><span class="token string">&#39;{.spec.template.spec.containers[0].image}{&quot;\\n&quot;}&#39;</span>
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>输出：</p><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-ext="text"><pre class="language-text"><code>nginx:1.26
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>这条命令虽然较长，但目的很简单：从 Deployment 的 Pod 模板中取出容器镜像。</p><h2 id="四、准备观察更新过程" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#四、准备观察更新过程" aria-hidden="true">#</a> 四、准备观察更新过程</h2><p>在第一个终端执行：</p><div class="language-bash line-numbers-mode" data-ext="sh"><pre class="language-bash"><code>kubectl get pods <span class="token parameter variable">-l</span> <span class="token string">&#39;app=qingyun-mall,tier=frontend&#39;</span> <span class="token parameter variable">-w</span>
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>保持这个终端运行。</p><h2 id="五、把镜像升级到-nginx-1-27" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#五、把镜像升级到-nginx-1-27" aria-hidden="true">#</a> 五、把镜像升级到 Nginx 1.27</h2><p>打开第二个终端，执行：</p><div class="language-bash line-numbers-mode" data-ext="sh"><pre class="language-bash"><code>kubectl <span class="token builtin class-name">set</span> image deployment/qingyun-mall-web <span class="token assign-left variable">nginx</span><span class="token operator">=</span>nginx:1.27
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>拆开理解：</p><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-ext="text"><pre class="language-text"><code>kubectl set image             修改容器镜像
deployment/qingyun-mall-web    操作这个 Deployment
nginx=nginx:1.27              名为 nginx 的容器改用 nginx:1.27
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>注意等号左边的 <code>nginx</code> 是 YAML 中的容器名称：</p><div class="language-yaml line-numbers-mode" data-ext="yml"><pre class="language-yaml"><code><span class="token key atrule">containers</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span>
  <span class="token punctuation">-</span> <span class="token key atrule">name</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> nginx
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>等号右边的 <code>nginx:1.27</code> 是新镜像。</p><h2 id="六、观察滚动替换" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#六、观察滚动替换" aria-hidden="true">#</a> 六、观察滚动替换</h2><p>回到第一个终端，你会看到：</p><ul><li>新 Pod 出现并进入 <code>ContainerCreating</code>；</li><li>新 Pod 变为 <code>Running</code>；</li><li>旧 Pod 进入 <code>Terminating</code>；</li><li>最终重新稳定为三个 Running Pod。</li></ul><p>完成后按 <code>Control + C</code>。</p><p>等待发布完成：</p><div class="language-bash line-numbers-mode" data-ext="sh"><pre class="language-bash"><code>kubectl rollout status deployment/qingyun-mall-web
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>再查询镜像：</p><div class="language-bash line-numbers-mode" data-ext="sh"><pre class="language-bash"><code>kubectl get deployment qingyun-mall-web <span class="token punctuation">\\</span>
  <span class="token parameter variable">-o</span> <span class="token assign-left variable">jsonpath</span><span class="token operator">=</span><span class="token string">&#39;{.spec.template.spec.containers[0].image}{&quot;\\n&quot;}&#39;</span>
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>现在应输出：</p><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-ext="text"><pre class="language-text"><code>nginx:1.27
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><h2 id="七、为什么修改镜像会创建新-pod" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#七、为什么修改镜像会创建新-pod" aria-hidden="true">#</a> 七、为什么修改镜像会创建新 Pod</h2><p>Deployment 的 <code>template</code> 是 Pod 模板。镜像正是模板的一部分：</p><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-ext="text"><pre class="language-text"><code>旧模板：image = nginx:1.26
新模板：image = nginx:1.27
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>已经运行的 Pod 不会在原地把镜像换掉。Deployment 会根据新模板创建新 Pod，并逐步删除旧 Pod。</p><p>所以升级本质上是：</p><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-ext="text"><pre class="language-text"><code>替换 Pod，而不是进入旧容器现场改程序
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><h2 id="八、查看发布历史" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#八、查看发布历史" aria-hidden="true">#</a> 八、查看发布历史</h2><p>执行：</p><div class="language-bash line-numbers-mode" data-ext="sh"><pre class="language-bash"><code>kubectl rollout <span class="token function">history</span> deployment/qingyun-mall-web
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>输出会列出 <code>REVISION</code>，也就是发布修订编号，例如：</p><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-ext="text"><pre class="language-text"><code>REVISION  CHANGE-CAUSE
1         &lt;none&gt;
2         &lt;none&gt;
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>可以先理解为：</p><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-ext="text"><pre class="language-text"><code>revision 1：最初的 Pod 模板
revision 2：修改镜像后的 Pod 模板
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p><code>CHANGE-CAUSE</code> 为空不影响本课实验。它只是说明我们没有额外记录发布说明。</p><h2 id="九、故意发布一个不存在的版本" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#九、故意发布一个不存在的版本" aria-hidden="true">#</a> 九、故意发布一个不存在的版本</h2><p>执行：</p><div class="language-bash line-numbers-mode" data-ext="sh"><pre class="language-bash"><code>kubectl <span class="token builtin class-name">set</span> image deployment/qingyun-mall-web <span class="token punctuation">\\</span>
  <span class="token assign-left variable">nginx</span><span class="token operator">=</span>nginx:lesson-version-does-not-exist
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>等待发布状态，但设置 20 秒超时：</p><div class="language-bash line-numbers-mode" data-ext="sh"><pre class="language-bash"><code>kubectl rollout status deployment/qingyun-mall-web <span class="token parameter variable">--timeout</span><span class="token operator">=</span>20s
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>这次预期不会显示成功，而会在超时后返回错误。因为新 Pod 无法拉取不存在的镜像。</p><p>查看 Pod：</p><div class="language-bash line-numbers-mode" data-ext="sh"><pre class="language-bash"><code>kubectl get pods <span class="token parameter variable">-l</span> <span class="token string">&#39;app=qingyun-mall,tier=frontend&#39;</span>
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>你会看到两类 Pod：</p><ul><li>旧版本 Pod 仍然 Running；</li><li>新版本 Pod 显示 <code>ErrImagePull</code> 或 <code>ImagePullBackOff</code>。</li></ul><p>这体现了滚动更新的价值：新版本没有准备好时，Deployment 通常不会立刻删光全部可用旧 Pod。</p><h2 id="十、确认失败原因" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#十、确认失败原因" aria-hidden="true">#</a> 十、确认失败原因</h2><p>先找出状态异常的新 Pod：</p><div class="language-bash line-numbers-mode" data-ext="sh"><pre class="language-bash"><code>kubectl get pods <span class="token parameter variable">-l</span> <span class="token string">&#39;app=qingyun-mall,tier=frontend&#39;</span>
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>复制异常 Pod 的完整名称，然后执行：</p><div class="language-bash line-numbers-mode" data-ext="sh"><pre class="language-bash"><code>kubectl describe pod <span class="token operator">&lt;</span>异常Pod名称<span class="token operator">&gt;</span>
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>查看底部 Events，应能发现：</p><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-ext="text"><pre class="language-text"><code>Failed to pull image
not found
ImagePullBackOff
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>这与第五课的错误镜像故障相同，只是这次发生在发布新版本期间。</p><h2 id="十一、回滚到上一次版本" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#十一、回滚到上一次版本" aria-hidden="true">#</a> 十一、回滚到上一次版本</h2><p>确认失败后，执行：</p><div class="language-bash line-numbers-mode" data-ext="sh"><pre class="language-bash"><code>kubectl rollout undo deployment/qingyun-mall-web
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p><code>undo</code> 表示撤销最近一次 Pod 模板变更，恢复到上一个修订版本。</p><p>等待回滚完成：</p><div class="language-bash line-numbers-mode" data-ext="sh"><pre class="language-bash"><code>kubectl rollout status deployment/qingyun-mall-web
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>查询镜像：</p><div class="language-bash line-numbers-mode" data-ext="sh"><pre class="language-bash"><code>kubectl get deployment qingyun-mall-web <span class="token punctuation">\\</span>
  <span class="token parameter variable">-o</span> <span class="token assign-left variable">jsonpath</span><span class="token operator">=</span><span class="token string">&#39;{.spec.template.spec.containers[0].image}{&quot;\\n&quot;}&#39;</span>
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>应恢复为：</p><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-ext="text"><pre class="language-text"><code>nginx:1.27
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>再看 Pod：</p><div class="language-bash line-numbers-mode" data-ext="sh"><pre class="language-bash"><code>kubectl get pods <span class="token parameter variable">-l</span> <span class="token string">&#39;app=qingyun-mall,tier=frontend&#39;</span>
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>最终应重新稳定为三个 <code>1/1 Running</code> Pod。</p><h2 id="十二、回滚不是恢复原来的-pod" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#十二、回滚不是恢复原来的-pod" aria-hidden="true">#</a> 十二、回滚不是恢复原来的 Pod</h2><p>与自动恢复一样，回滚恢复的是以前的 Pod 模板，而不是把被删除的旧 Pod 原地找回来。</p><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-ext="text"><pre class="language-text"><code>恢复旧模板
   ↓
根据旧模板创建替代 Pod
   ↓
删除失败版本 Pod
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>所以回滚后 Pod 名称仍可能发生变化。</p><h2 id="十三、本地-yaml-又与集群不一致了" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#十三、本地-yaml-又与集群不一致了" aria-hidden="true">#</a> 十三、本地 YAML 又与集群不一致了</h2><p>实验 YAML 仍写着：</p><div class="language-yaml line-numbers-mode" data-ext="yml"><pre class="language-yaml"><code><span class="token key atrule">image</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> nginx<span class="token punctuation">:</span><span class="token number">1.26</span>
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>但是经过升级和回滚后，集群当前是：</p><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-ext="text"><pre class="language-text"><code>nginx:1.27
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>因为 <code>kubectl set image</code> 和 <code>kubectl rollout undo</code> 修改的是集群对象，不会自动改写本地文件。</p><p>如果此时重新 apply 初始 YAML：</p><div class="language-bash line-numbers-mode" data-ext="sh"><pre class="language-bash"><code>kubectl apply <span class="token parameter variable">-f</span> labs/06-滚动更新/01-nginx-deployment-v1.yaml
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>集群会再次按照文件回到 <code>nginx:1.26</code>。</p><p>本课为了清楚观察过程使用命令修改。实际项目中应把最终镜像版本写回受 Git 管理的部署配置，保证文件记录与集群期望一致。</p><h2 id="十四、清理实验" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#十四、清理实验" aria-hidden="true">#</a> 十四、清理实验</h2><p>执行：</p><div class="language-bash line-numbers-mode" data-ext="sh"><pre class="language-bash"><code>kubectl delete <span class="token parameter variable">-f</span> labs/06-滚动更新/01-nginx-deployment-v1.yaml
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>虽然文件中写的是旧镜像，但删除依据主要是对象类型和名称，所以仍会删除当前名为 <code>qingyun-mall-web</code> 的 Deployment。</p><p>确认：</p><div class="language-bash line-numbers-mode" data-ext="sh"><pre class="language-bash"><code>kubectl get deployment,replicaset,pod <span class="token parameter variable">-l</span> <span class="token string">&#39;app=qingyun-mall,tier=frontend&#39;</span>
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>下层资源可能短暂显示 <code>Terminating</code>，稍等后再次查询，最终应全部消失。</p><h2 id="十五、问题与直接回答" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#十五、问题与直接回答" aria-hidden="true">#</a> 十五、问题与直接回答</h2><h3 id="滚动更新会一次性删除所有旧-pod-吗" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#滚动更新会一次性删除所有旧-pod-吗" aria-hidden="true">#</a> 滚动更新会一次性删除所有旧 Pod 吗？</h3><p>通常不会。Deployment 会逐步创建新 Pod、删除旧 Pod，尽量在更新期间保留可用副本。</p><h3 id="更新镜像是在原容器里替换程序吗" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#更新镜像是在原容器里替换程序吗" aria-hidden="true">#</a> 更新镜像是在原容器里替换程序吗？</h3><p>不是。Pod 模板变化后，Deployment 创建使用新镜像的新 Pod，并删除旧 Pod。</p><h3 id="rollout-status-成功代表业务功能一定正确吗" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#rollout-status-成功代表业务功能一定正确吗" aria-hidden="true">#</a> <code>rollout status</code> 成功代表业务功能一定正确吗？</h3><p>不代表。它表示 Deployment 的发布状态达到预期。业务接口和页面仍需要实际请求验证，后面学习健康检查后还会改善判断能力。</p><h3 id="新镜像拉取失败-为什么旧-pod-还在" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#新镜像拉取失败-为什么旧-pod-还在" aria-hidden="true">#</a> 新镜像拉取失败，为什么旧 Pod 还在？</h3><p>因为新 Pod 尚未可用，滚动更新策略不会直接把所有旧的可用副本删除。</p><h3 id="rollout-undo-恢复的是原-pod-吗" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#rollout-undo-恢复的是原-pod-吗" aria-hidden="true">#</a> <code>rollout undo</code> 恢复的是原 Pod 吗？</h3><p>不是。它恢复上一个 Pod 模板，再根据该模板创建替代 Pod。</p><h3 id="为什么回滚后本地-yaml-没变" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#为什么回滚后本地-yaml-没变" aria-hidden="true">#</a> 为什么回滚后本地 YAML 没变？</h3><p>因为回滚操作修改的是集群中的 Deployment，不会自动编辑本地文件。</p><h2 id="本课只记住五句话" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#本课只记住五句话" aria-hidden="true">#</a> 本课只记住五句话</h2><ol><li>滚动更新通过逐步创建新 Pod、删除旧 Pod 完成版本替换。</li><li>修改 Pod 模板不会原地修改旧 Pod，而会创建替代 Pod。</li><li><code>rollout status</code> 查看发布是否完成，<code>rollout history</code> 查看修订历史。</li><li>新版本失败后，可以用 <code>rollout undo</code> 恢复上一个 Pod 模板。</li><li>发布或回滚后仍要让本地配置与集群最终版本保持一致。</li></ol><h2 id="下一课预告" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#下一课预告" aria-hidden="true">#</a> 下一课预告</h2><p>下一课开始学习 Service。你会先亲眼看到 Pod 被替换后 IP 发生变化，再创建一个不会跟着 Pod 变化的稳定访问入口。</p>`,149),d=[l];function t(r,p){return a(),n("div",null,d)}const o=e(i,[["render",t],["__file","09-第八课-滚动更新与回滚.html.vue"]]);export{o as default};
